{
  "info": {
    "name": "Manka — Backend API Tests",
    "_postman_id": "4d83fe3d-432b-431c-94e1-dd07ec1f90e3",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas automáticas para el backend de Manka.\n\nCómo usarla:\n1. Levanta PostgreSQL/Docker y luego ejecuta la API de Manka.\n2. Por defecto se asume http://localhost:8083; puedes cambiar `baseUrl` en el environment.\n3. Importa esta colección y `Manka.postman_environment.json` en Postman.\n4. Selecciona el environment `Manka - Local`.\n5. Ejecuta la colección completa con Collection Runner EN ORDEN.\n\nLa colección crea un usuario único en cada corrida, obtiene un JWT y reutiliza ese token en los endpoints protegidos. Las pruebas usan los IDs sembrados por data.sql: ingrediente 1 = Pollo, ingrediente 4 = Arroz y plato 1 = Arroz chaufa de pollo.\n\nSe validan: autenticación, catálogo y búsqueda de ingredientes, platos y filtro de tiempo, recomendaciones (ranking, cobertura > 0 y límite de tiempo), despensa, historial y penalización por repetición, favoritos, 404, 409, validación 400, JSON inválido y 401 sin token.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8083"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwtToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userEmail",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userPassword",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "uniqueSuffix",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "favoriteDishId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "initialChaufaScore60",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 Registrar usuario de pruebas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const suffix = Date.now().toString();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('uniqueSuffix', suffix);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userEmail', `manka.${suffix}@test.com`);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userPassword', 'manka123');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('jwtToken', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('initialChaufaScore60', '');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('[Setup] Registro exitoso responde 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('[Setup] Respuesta de registro contiene id', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.id);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Sebastian\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Prueba\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "0.2 Login y guardar JWT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('[Setup] Login responde 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('[Setup] Guarda un JWT válido', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(body.token.split('.').length).to.eql(3);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwtToken', body.token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
